      ["PROGRESS"] = "Discover the Pack-howler's Hill"; 
      ["LORE"] = "This isolated hill in the Dourstocks is a rallying point for the wolf-packs of Mirkwood; mournful howls can often be heard upon the wind from this direction."; 
