      ["LORE"] = "You have discovered the city of Linhir which straddles the river on either side, guarding a ford and bridge. Part of the town belongs to Lebennin, and part to Belfalas. It is normally a quiet harbor of fisherfolk, but has been assailed and partially destroyed by the Haradrim and Corsairs of Umbar, who besieged it and fought long against its defenders, led by Lord Angbor of Lamedon and Comeldir, a swan-knight entrusted by Prince Imrahil with guardianship over the far reaches of his province."; 
